  "system": {
    "description": "Rover morphs are smaller, defense-oriented rollers loosely based on sphere morph designs. Each rover is 0.6 meters in diameter and, with its limbs retracted, has the ominous appearance of a reflective, shiny, black globe. It can extrude two manipulating arms and 2 other articulating weapon mounts equipped with a pistol and an agonizer on default models. Rovers are stealthy and highly maneuverable and so favored for bodyguard and police purposes in some areas. They are often deployed via remote control.",
